        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2402.12993">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2402.12993">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2402.12993">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
