        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.18243">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2503.18243">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2503.18243">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
