    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        INSIGHT: Bridging the Student-Teacher Gap in Times of Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Thys%2C+J">Jarne Thys</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Vanbrabant%2C+S">Sebe Vanbrabant</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Vanacken%2C+D">Davy Vanacken</a>, 
      
