        KAG-Thinker: Interactive Thinking and Deep Reasoning in LLMs via Knowledge-Augmented Generation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+D">Dalong Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xu%2C+J">Jun Xu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhou%2C+J">Jun Zhou</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liang%2C+L">Lei Liang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yuan%2C+L">Lin Yuan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhong%2C+L">Ling Zhong</a>, 
      
